From d13ecc6d05730c7a1f658b3e0b31ef6edc9df3af Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: leonardpitzu <leonard.pitzu@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 16:57:15 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Salus SQ610RFNH presets, add SQ610RF

Turning an iT600 thermostat on always set permanent hold (manual), which
switches off the program set on the thermostat. Expose the hold type as a
preset (schedule, manual, away) and as a hold_type diagnostic, turn on in
the preset the thermostat had before it was turned off, and write nothing
when it is already on. Mode writes wait for the thermostat's echo and run
one after the other per thermostat.

The SQ610RF uses the same protocol and is added as a white label.
